        "headline": "俄軍機11月17日穿越臺灣防空識別區 國防部譴責並將持續監控",
        "summary": "俄軍機11月17日航經臺灣東部空域，清晨穿越臺灣防空識別區。國防部18日表示，國軍運用聯合情報、監視及偵察手段掌握動態並依規定應處。國防部譴責俄軍機穿越識別區及侵犯鄰國領空，指其衝擊區域穩定；未透露國軍是否派機，並將持續監控。防空識別區不同於領空，這項說明不代表俄機進入臺灣領空。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan defence ministry condemns Russian military aircraft's November 17 transit of its air defence identification zone and will keep monitoring",
        "summary_en": "Russian military aircraft flew through airspace east of Taiwan on November 17 and crossed Taiwan's air defence identification zone early that morning. On November 18, the defence ministry said Taiwan's military used joint intelligence, surveillance and reconnaissance to monitor the aircraft and respond under established procedures. The ministry condemned the transit and reported incursions into a neighbouring country's airspace as harmful to regional stability. It did not say whether Taiwan deployed aircraft and will continue monitoring. The identification zone is distinct from territorial airspace; the ministry's account does not establish that the aircraft entered Taiwan's territorial airspace.",
